    182→I'm Rui Ueyama. I'm the creator of [8cc](https://github.com/rui314/8cc),
    183→which is a hobby C compiler, and also the original creator of the current
    184→version of [LLVM lld](https://lld.llvm.org) linker, which is a
    185→production-quality linker used by various operating systems and large-scale
    186→build systems.
